  "stageId": null,
  "title": "炙熱衝擊！",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_therex_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f70844dc4a9be751b234a46b05d92c2be4ab74a54622bead98b96e455cbdc9ff",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "个人剧情 Thermal-EX"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "2:30 P. M. 天氣/晴\n羅德島本艦 總工程師辦公室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程幹員",
      "text": "老大，這是這個月船上各區的線路安全報告。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "嗯，嗯......沒什麼問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "嗯？這裡有一點小波動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "——凌晨兩點到早上六點，每一天晚上都有相似的異常？這個區域是宿舍區吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程幹員",
      "text": "是宿舍區。這麼一說，我也想起來了，開始那幾天，那附近還有人報告過停電。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程幹員",
      "text": "我們過去一看，線路都是好的，只是單位時間輸出功率超過閾值了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "啊嚏——呃，說起來，辦公室是不是有點冷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程幹員",
      "text": "是有一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程幹員",
      "text": "應該說這段時間一直都有點冷......室內溫度是不是該再調高點？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "忍忍吧，節能比較重要！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "說正經的，這些異常，看來應該又是哪個小壞蛋偷偷使用違規電器吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程幹員",
      "text": "對了老大，那幾次我去檢查，在走廊附近看到了Thermal-EX。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "咦？難道不是違規電器，是電器違規？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程幹員",
      "text": "要我去把Thermal-EX叫來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "先看看他在哪裡。幹員日誌......找到啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "啊，Thermal-EX現在正在敘拉古出外勤？同行人裡面有——博士？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "呃，這倒是，沒想到......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "算啦，就算有問題，也肯定是小問題，應該還好吧？博士在的話，就算出問題也能搞定的啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "等他們回來，再去找凱爾希問問情況好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "敘拉古拉克瑪蒂瓦 羅德島辦事處"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫藥公司代表",
      "text": "合約條款沒什麼問題了，麻煩您千里迢迢跑這一趟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫藥公司代表",
      "text": "這次有機會見到羅德島的博士，真是意外的榮幸。也請您回去之後，向阿米婭女士轉達我們的謝意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這都是應該的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "偶爾出來溜達下也挺好。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫藥公司代表",
          "text": "接下來，只需要您將藥物配方和樣品交給我——",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Thermal-EX。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "嗷嗷！終於輪到我閃亮登場了嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫藥公司代表",
          "text": "說、說話了？！我還以為這只是個長得有些嚇人的機器......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "誕生於雷神工業最新技術，經天才的可露希爾和偉大的梅爾攜手改造，我是這個時代最完美的機——器——人！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "這位先生，您的驚訝我非常理解。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "順便提一句，我能做到的事超乎你的想像，請您注視著我炙熱的身體，不要眨眼，我將會為您表演光與熱的魔術——",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "咳咳，Thermal-EX。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "博士，您又在呼喚我嗎？我知道您需要我，只要您一聲令下，我什麼都能為您做到。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我正要說。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我想讓你繼續保持沉默。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "瞭解了！Thermal-EX，即刻切斷控制連結——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幹員直尺",
          "text": "等下等下，也不用直接關機吧！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幹員直尺",
          "text": "咳咳。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幹員直尺",
          "text": "博士，這十張可攜式源石磁碟已經準備好了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫藥公司代表",
          "text": "這些就是本次交易的藥物配方嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "稍等。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "唔噢，唔唔唔噢！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "等Thermal-EX完成資料傳輸，這些資料就能交給你，代表先生。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫藥公司代表",
          "text": "真是奇妙的機器......呃，機器人！羅德島果然不同凡響，不僅僅在醫藥領域，連工程技術也如此傑出。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "謝謝！您的眼光同樣不同凡響！這熱烈的誇獎讓我更有動力了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫藥公司代表",
          "text": "呵......呵呵......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "傳輸進度，百分之五十。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斑點",
          "text": "終於快要解脫了嗎？我居然有一點點懷念A6那幾個傢伙了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斑點",
          "text": "至少他們還會正常說話，不至於像這幾位臨時隊友，不是惜字如金，就是聒噪個不停。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "守林人",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "斑點先生，您昨天還靠在我身上烘乾了被雨打濕的毛髮，哪怕只有短短十分鐘，與您拉近的距離依然讓我燥熱了起來！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斑點",
          "text": "咳咳。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "傳輸進度，百分之七十五。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫藥公司代表",
          "text": "呼，這次合作真是超乎我想像的順利——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "守林人",
          "text": "別說話。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "醫藥公司代表",
          "text": "啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斑點",
          "text": "嘖，這位朋友，你真是擁有一張十分幸運的嘴。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "守林人",
          "text": "趴下！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幹員直尺",
          "text": "什、什麼？沿街那面的牆被炸開了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "啊，這熟悉的熱量衝擊！不過與我的能量相比，還是不值一提。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "博士，有我擋在您面前，您應該沒事吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我沒事。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "作為掩體，你矮了點。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幹員直尺",
          "text": "看這源石炸彈的規模，是當地幫派幹的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幹員直尺",
          "text": "這挺奇怪的，我們在這裡活動這麼久了，除了偶爾摩擦，基本相安無事。畢竟我們也會為他們提供一些藥品。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "喔我知道了！他們一定是看上了我——畢竟哪裡還有我這樣完美華麗、熱量滿滿的機器人呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "有我在的話，他們根本就不需要這些粗糙的爆破物品了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斑點",
          "text": "......有時候我真懷疑他是月見夜的親兄弟。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "守林人",
          "text": "他有可能是對的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斑點",
          "text": "哦？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "守林人",
          "text": "有組織有計畫的襲擊，一定有明確的目標，並且在準確的時機。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Thermal-EX攜帶的配方。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "守林人",
          "text": "看來是交易資訊洩露。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幹員直尺",
          "text": "守林人小姐掃視著我們每一個人的眼神......有些可怕。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "守林人",
          "text": "打我朋友主意的人都不可原諒。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斑點",
          "text": "喂，說到配方，這個什麼代表，他好像暈過去了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斑點",
          "text": "也太弱了吧。站得離牆那麼遠，只是被嚇到了而已。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "守林人",
          "text": "都做好準備。有敵人靠近。五個。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Thermal-EX——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "好的博士，全部交給我吧！我的熱情正在醞釀！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "——注意時機。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "守林人",
          "text": "來了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "噢噢噢全力衝擊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "守林人",
          "text": "全倒了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斑點",
          "text": "還真是有效率......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "呃......呃......炙熱......炙......熱......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斑點",
          "text": "......然而是個一波流。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幹員直尺",
          "text": "Thermal-EX他還好吧？我有些聽不懂他在說什麼。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "炙......熱......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這是短時間內輸出能量強度過高引起的其餘功能模組暫時失靈。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "過幾分鐘就好，不必驚慌。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "守林人",
          "text": "外面還有敵人。這一批人更多。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斑點",
          "text": "多也沒事吧？難道我們打不贏？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "守林人",
          "text": "我一個人就可以。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斑點",
          "text": "......你看，甚至用不上複數詞。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幹員直尺",
          "text": "各位，後面還有一條路可以出去......畢竟這辦事處之前也是安全屋。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "斑點，你和直尺帶代表先生從安全通道撤退。",
