        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅爾",
          "text": "嗯？哪句？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "——這不是巧合。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "我想，這對Thermal-EX來說，的確不是巧合。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但Thermal-EX能擁有這樣獨特的個性，這本身是一個巧合。",
